  "name": "smlibpy / smlibpy-three (open CAD kernel for Python, WASM, three.js)",
  "summary": "Open-source CAD modeling library on the SMLib NURBS kernel (from NVIDIA-Omniverse/usd-brep): exact B-rep solids and surfaces in Python, in JS via WebAssembly (smlibwasm) and in three.js (smlibpy-three, ops yield THREE.Mesh with selection and raycast). Reads STEP/IGES/USD/DXF, writes STEP/USD/DXF/SVG/STL/glTF/.brep, ships an MCP server so agents can build parts. No account.",
  "category": "tools",
