    "price": "$0",
    "notes": "Bundled SMLib kernel © NVIDIA under Apache-2.0 (see NOTICE); PyPI metadata also lists OFL-1.1 for a bundled font. v0.6, assemblies and 2D drawing dimensions not yet supported. smlibpy-three needs three r186+."
  },
  "procedure": [
    "Python: pip install smlibpy (add [mcp] for the MCP server)",
    "three.js: npm install @classcad/smlibpy-three three",
